            ╭ D E T A I L ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
            │  Keep Awake  [built-in]                                                                      │
            │  Keep your Mac awake for a set time or until you stop it. By default it also nudges the      │
            │  cursor once you go idle, so chat apps don't mark you Away. Start a session, come back later │
            │  and run Stop. macOS only. CLI/desktop only.                                                 │
            │                                                                                              │
            │  PARAMETERS                                                                                  │
            │                                                                                              │
            │  > Action   < Start a session >                                                              │
            │      Start a new session, stop the running one, or check what's currently active.            │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Session Length   1 hour                                                                   │
            │      How long to stay awake. Ignored for Stop and Check status.                              │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Display   Keep display awake (recommended)                                                │
            │      Keep the display awake so it doesn't sleep. Allow sleep if you only need background     │
            │      tasks to keep running.                                                                  │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Activity Simulation   After 2 minutes idle (recommended)                                  │
            │      Keeping the Mac awake doesn't reset the system idle timer, so chat apps still mark you  │
            │      Away. This nudges the cursor 1px once you've been idle this long. Needs Accessibility   │
            │      permission for your terminal app.                                                       │
            │                                                                                              │
            ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
